Everything else this repo uses is OpenMM's code under OpenMM's licenses. build.sh fetches it at build
time and the repo holds none of it, except the patches.

patches/*.patch
    Edits to OpenMM's files: 0001 to 0004 change its CMake files, and 0005 changes how its common platform
    code wraps molecules into the periodic box. They are OpenMM code and carry OpenMM's license for the
    files they change (MIT for the API, the build files and the RPMD plugin; LGPL 3 for platforms/metal
    and platforms/common).

